The eigenvalue equation $-i\frac{d\psi_k}{dx}=k\psi_k$ has the solution $\psi_k(x)\propto e^{ikx}
  =\cos(kx)+i\sin(kx).$ Indeed, $-i\frac{d}{dx}e^{ikx}
  =
  -i(ik)e^{ikx}
  =
  k e^{ikx}.$

